    <style:master-page style:name="Default" style:page-layout-name="PageLayout"/>
  </office:master-styles>
  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">주민세 사업소분 건축물 사용명세서(건물 소유자 작성)　문의전화 : 032-509-8920 (fax.032-509-8928)</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="사용명세서" table:style-name="FormTable">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col1"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col2"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col3"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col4"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col5"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col6"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col7"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col8"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col9"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">건축물 소재지</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p text:style-name="Body">도로명 주소:</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">건축물 소유자</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">성 명(법인명)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">생년월일(법인등록번호)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">연면적(가설건축물 포함)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="Body">m²</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">연 락 처</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="9"><text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">사 용 현 황(7월 1일 기준)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">①구분<br/>(층별,호수)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">②사용현황<br/>(자가,임대,공실 등)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">③사용면적(m²)<br/>(전용+공용)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">④상 호</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">⑤사 용 자</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">성 명<br/>(법인명)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">생년월일<br/>(법인등록번호)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">사업자등록번호</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">사용기간 (임대·<br/>공실 포함)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">연락처</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">⑥합 계</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p text:style-name="Body">⑦비 고 :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="9">
            <text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">작성일 :　 년　 월　 일</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">확인자(건물 소유자)　　　　　　　　　(인 또는 서명)</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="SmallBold">※ 작성방법</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Small">① 구분란에는 건물 내 사용 중인 사업장별(공실 포함) 층, 호수를 표시합니다. (ex. 3층 302호), ② 사용현황란에는 자가(건물주 직접사용), 임대(임차인 사용), 공실(미사용)</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Small">③ 사용면적(m²)는 전용면적과 공용면적 합계를 기재하되, 공용면적 사용 구분이 명백하지 않은 경우 전용면적 비율로 나눈 면적을 공용면적으로 계산합니다.</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Small">④ 상호란에는 사용하는 사업장 이름을 기재합니다. ⑤ 사용자는 건물주 또는 임차인 등 해당 사용자의 관련사항을 기재합니다.(사용기간은 임대, 공실의 경우에도 그 기간을 기재)⑥</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Small">사용면적 합계는 건축물 연면적과 동일해야 합니다. ⑦ 비고란에는 임차인이 휴업, 폐업, 전출하여 사업자가 없는 경우에는 그 사유와 발생일을 기재합니다.</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="SmallBold">※ 「지방세법」제75조2항 및 같은 법 시행령 제80조에 따라 건축물 소유자에게도 제2차 납세의무를 지울 수 있으므로 성실히 작성하여 주시기 바랍니다.</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Body"/>
      <table:table table:name="개인정보동의" table:style-name="FormTable">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="PrivacyLeft"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="PrivacyRight"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="PrivacyCell"><text:p text:style-name="BoldCenter">개인정보<br/>수집· 동의 안내</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="PrivacyCell">
            <text:p text:style-name="Body">개인정보의 수집 및 이용에 동의하십니까?　　■ 동의함　 □동의안함</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Body">※ 「개인정보보호법」에 따라 수집·보유 및 처리하는 개인정보(성명, 생년월일, 법인등록번호, 전화번호)는 주민세(사업소분) 과세 목적으로 사용 할</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Body">예정이며, 문서보존기간 종료 즉시 안전한 방법으로 폐기 처리할 예정입니다.</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
</office:document>